"macOS keeps the current Focus in ~/Library/DoNotDisturb, which needs Full Disk Access. Grant it in System Settings > Privacy & Security if you want CrewTower to go quiet with the rest of the system." = "macOS 将当前专注模式保存在 ~/Library/DoNotDisturb，读取需要完全磁盘访问权限。如需 CrewTower 随系统一起静音，请在“系统设置 > 隐私与安全性”中授予权限。";
