"Mirroring and a macOS screen-sharing connection can be detected. Sharing a window into a call cannot be, from any app: use the switch above." = "可以检测屏幕镜像和 macOS 屏幕共享连接，但无法检测任何应用在通话中共享单个窗口的情况；此时请使用上方开关。";
