"Codex will not run CrewTower's hooks yet" = "Codex 尚未获准运行 CrewTower 的钩子";
"Run `codex` in a terminal, type /hooks, and press t to trust CrewTower." = "在终端运行 codex，输入 /hooks，然后按 t 信任 CrewTower。";
"CrewTower reads ChatGPT's local session state on this Mac to tell when ChatGPT is waiting for you, and to stay quiet when ChatGPT's automatic review is handling a request. It reads only the threads the notch is showing, and nothing leaves your Mac." = "CrewTower 读取此 Mac 上 ChatGPT 的本地会话状态，判断它何时需要你处理，并在 ChatGPT 自动审核请求时保持安静。它只读取刘海区域中显示的对话，所有数据都保留在本机。";
"Every other agent was installed normally. Resolve what the message names and the next launch will pick it up; nothing here is edited without your say-so." = "其他智能体均已正常安装。解决消息中指出的问题后，下次启动会重新检测；未经你的同意，不会修改这里的内容。";
"One agent's hooks could not be installed" = "一个智能体的钩子无法安装";
"Tab-precise jumping is off" = "精确跳转到标签页已关闭";
"Something set CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_TERMINAL_TITLE in ~/.claude/settings.json, which stops Claude Code naming its terminal tab. That name is what lets the notch jump to the exact tab when several sessions share a folder, so in Ghostty and other tabbed terminals every jump is currently falling back to guessing by working directory. Turning it back on affects only this one setting." = "~/.claude/settings.json 中设置了 CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_TERMINAL_TITLE，导致 Claude Code 无法命名终端标签页。当多个会话共用文件夹时，刘海区域需要标签页名称才能精确跳转；目前在 Ghostty 等支持标签页的终端中，只能按工作目录推测目标。重新开启只会影响这一项设置。";
"CrewTower will remove its hooks from every agent's config and its Claude Code plugin if you turned it on, forget this Mac's license, and stop launching at login. Your agents and their settings are otherwise untouched." = "CrewTower 会从所有智能体配置中移除自己的钩子，移除已启用的 Claude Code 插件，清除此 Mac 的许可证，并关闭登录时启动。智能体及其其他设置保持原样。";
"Several worktrees of one repository all show the same folder name; the branch is what tells their cards apart." = "同一仓库的多个工作树可能显示相同的文件夹名称；分支名称可以帮助区分会话卡片。";
"Claude Code's own running total at API prices, the figure /cost shows. On a Pro or Max plan it is not money you were charged. The context breakdown always shows it." = "这是 Claude Code 按 API 价格累计的费用，与 /cost 显示的数值一致。在 Pro 或 Max 方案中，它并不代表实际扣费。上下文详情中始终会显示此数值。";
"Helper sessions that run from Claude Code's own config directory rather than a project." = "在 Claude Code 自身配置目录中运行的辅助会话。";
"Scratchpad and throwaway sessions under /private/tmp." = "/private/tmp 中的临时会话。";
"Quiet hours are active - sounds are muted" = "当前处于免打扰时段，声音已静音";
"Nothing plays while that terminal is in front, the screen is locked, or the notch is snoozed." = "终端位于前台、屏幕锁定或刘海区域暂停提示时，不播放声音。";
"An agent's turn stopped on an error." = "一个智能体因错误停止了本轮执行。";
"CrewTower adds observation hooks to ~/.claude/settings.json so sessions appear in the notch. A backup is saved as settings.json.crewtower.bak. Existing settings are preserved. Applies to newly started sessions." = "CrewTower 会向 ~/.claude/settings.json 添加观察钩子，让会话显示在刘海区域。备份保存为 settings.json.crewtower.bak，现有设置会保留。此更改对新启动的会话生效。";
"Claude Code is already reporting sessions to CrewTower. New sessions appear in the notch automatically." = "Claude Code 已在向 CrewTower 报告会话状态。新会话会自动显示在刘海区域。";
"CrewTower can jump to the exact terminal window. Approvals and answers do not need this permission." = "CrewTower 可以跳转到对应的终端窗口。批准请求和回答问题不需要此权限。";
"Privacy Mode (screen is mirrored)" = "隐私模式（屏幕正在镜像）";
"Runs in the background" = "在后台运行";
