"Your license key is shown as soon as the payment goes through, and it stays on your purchases page at Polar, which your receipt links to. It is not sent by email." = "付款成功后会立即显示许可证密钥。你也可以通过收据链接，在 Polar 的购买记录页面查看；密钥不会通过电子邮件发送。";
"Enter your key again below; nothing was lost." = "请在下方重新输入密钥，你的数据没有丢失。";
"This build of CrewTower does not carry its Claude Code plugin." = "此版本的 CrewTower 未包含 Claude Code 插件。";
"This build's plugin manifest is not an object." = "此版本的插件清单格式错误，应为 JSON 对象。";
"Claude Code answered in a way CrewTower does not understand." = "CrewTower 无法解析 Claude Code 的响应。";
"CrewTower could not find Claude Code on this Mac, nor Claude Desktop's copy of it. Install Claude Code, then try again." = "CrewTower 未在此 Mac 上找到 Claude Code，也未找到 Claude Desktop 内置的版本。请安装 Claude Code 后重试。";
"Claude Code did not list CrewTower's plugin as on after installing it." = "安装后，Claude Code 未将 CrewTower 插件列为已启用。";
"Claude Code still lists CrewTower's plugin after removing it." = "移除后，Claude Code 仍列出了 CrewTower 插件。";
"Restart Claude Desktop to update, then start a new session" = "重启 Claude Desktop 以更新，然后新建会话";
"Type /reload-plugins in this session to send prompts from here" = "在此会话中输入 /reload-plugins，即可从这里发送提示词";
"Installs CrewTower's plugin in Claude Code for your user, so new sessions in a terminal or in Claude Desktop's Code tab take a prompt, Stop and Compact from the notch. Turning it off uninstalls it." = "为当前用户的 Claude Code 安装 CrewTower 插件，让终端或 Claude Desktop 的 Code 标签页中新建的会话支持从刘海区域发送提示词、停止执行和压缩上下文。关闭此选项会卸载插件。";
"Removing CrewTower's plugin from Claude Code" = "正在从 Claude Code 移除 CrewTower 插件";
"Installing CrewTower's plugin in Claude Code" = "正在向 Claude Code 安装 CrewTower 插件";
"CrewTower's plugin was turned on after this session started. /reload-plugins loads it into this session; a new session has it from the start." = "CrewTower 插件在此会话启动后才启用。输入 /reload-plugins 可在当前会话加载；新建会话会自动加载。";
"Click any session and I'll take you straight to that terminal, on the exact tab. macOS only lets me do that with Accessibility turned on." = "点击任意会话即可跳转到对应终端的准确标签页。macOS 要求先授予辅助功能权限。";
"What it lets me do: find your terminal window and bring it to the front. What it does not: read your screen, or type anything anywhere. There is no keystroke path in this app at all." = "此权限用于查找终端窗口并将其置于前台，不用于读取屏幕或模拟键盘输入。应用没有发送模拟按键的功能。";
"I watch your agents on this Mac and that's the whole job. No account, no sign-up, and nothing of yours ever leaves it. Whatever you're building stays between you and your terminal." = "我只监测此 Mac 上的智能体，无需账户或注册，你的数据不会离开本机。你的项目内容只保留在你和终端之间。";
"If you don't answer I'll nudge a couple more times, then leave you alone. I stay quiet while you're already in that terminal, while you're away from your desk, and while your screen is locked." = "如果你没有回应，我会再提醒几次，然后停止打扰。当你正在使用对应终端、离开电脑或锁定屏幕时，我会保持安静。";
"You can read exactly what it wants to run and say yes from up there, without a keystroke going anywhere near it. I won't yank you out of whatever you're in the middle of." = "你可以在刘海区域查看智能体要执行的内容并批准，无需模拟按键，也无需中断当前工作。";
"Every session gets a row up there: which project it's in, what it's doing right now, how much context it has left. That one's a puppet show - I wrote those lines myself. No agent is running and not one token of yours was harmed." = "每个会话都会显示所在项目、当前任务和剩余上下文。这里展示的是演示内容，没有运行智能体，也没有消耗你的 token。";
"Banked resets refill the 5-hour and weekly limits when you use one, and move your weekly reset date. Use them in ChatGPT's Usage settings." = "使用储备的重置次数会补满 5 小时和每周额度，并调整每周重置日期。请在 ChatGPT 的用量设置中使用。";
"Read from your Claude Code login on this Mac, using the same account the CLI uses. Nothing is sent anywhere else. The quota is checked every few minutes rather than continuously, so this never costs you rate limit headroom." = "通过此 Mac 上 Claude Code 的登录信息读取，使用与命令行相同的账户。不会向其他地方发送数据。每隔几分钟检查一次额度，不会持续查询或消耗你的速率额度。";
"Read from the logins Claude Code and Codex already have on this Mac. Nothing is sent anywhere else. Each account is checked every few minutes rather than continuously, so this never costs you rate limit headroom." = "通过此 Mac 上 Claude Code 和 Codex 已有的登录信息读取。不会向其他地方发送数据。每隔几分钟检查一次各账户，不会持续查询或消耗你的速率额度。";
